    "relay": "ETH/BNB/SOL/XRP follow a BTC1h impulse of at least1%; own1h return has same sign but is no more than half BTC magnitude. BTC hourly quote volume>=1.5x previous24h average. Own closed H1 EMA50/200 agrees; current15m price breaks previous candle in trend direction and buyer share>=0.55 for BUY or<=0.45 for SELL. Stop wider of2ATR14 or previous8bar extreme; target2.5R;8h maximum.",
    "flow": "Closed H1 prior24h path efficiency<=0.20 and EMA50/EMA200 distance<=1H1ATR. Recent16bar low/high exceeds prior16bar extreme. Recent4bar native taker-buy share improves by>=0.15 versus the4bars ending16bars ago (or worsens symmetrically); current share>=0.55/<=0.45 and current close breaks prior candle high/low. Price remains in outer25% of previous32bar range. Stop beyond recent16bar extreme by0.25ATR or1.5ATR minimum; target previous32bar midpoint, RR>=1.3;8h maximum. This is observed taker-flow divergence, not synthetic CVD or whale/liquidation evidence.",
    "shock": "Closed H1 EMA50/200 and price/EMA50 agree. Previous15m candle moves against trend by>=1.5 priorATR, has range>=2.5priorATR and quote volume>=2x preceding24h mean. Current close recovers at least half previous real body and moves with trend; buyer share>=0.60 or<=0.40. Stop beyond shock/current extreme by0.25ATR and at least1.5ATR;target2R;8h maximum. Volume shock is not verified liquidation/news evidence.",
    "geometry": "All targets positive and directional, minimum0.5% stop distance, target price move>=5x19bp modeled roundtrip costs. No arbitrary confidence probability.",
    "costsBps": {
      "feeBps": 10,
      "spreadBps": 2,
      "slippageBps": 4,
      "fundingBps": 3
    },
    "stressMultiplier": 1.5,
    "accounting": "Next native15m open; full target/no BE; conservative stop-first collisions and adverse gap fills;8h maximum; incomplete horizon remains OPEN. One active per symbol per experiment; COMBINED uses existing canonical arbitrator with equal fixed rule scores and deterministic IDs. Independent signal R, not netted account/portfolio returns.",
    "activity": "Measure candidate decisions and actual non-excluded research entries by UTCdate across all536days after10day warmup. Include zero-signal days, active-day share, average/median/max entries and longest zero-entry streak. One trade/day is a service aspiration, never a forced-entry rule or guaranteed delivery count.",
    "gates": {
      "minimumPooledResolved": 100,
      "minimumEligibleAssetResolved": 10,
      "minimumEachDirectionResolved": 20,
      "minimumNetPF": 1.2,
      "minimumMeanR": 0.02,
      "positiveEachEligibleAsset": true,
      "positiveEachDirection": true,
      "positiveEachCalendarSlice": true,
      "positiveStress": true
    },
    "disclosure": "Three fixed hypotheses after prior failures. All dates/assets are reused development. No parameter sweep, later-period rescue or dropping losing eligible assets. BTC is structurally ineligible for following itself in relay. Native source ZIP/CHECKSUM verification is required. No independent holdout/production parity/edge or release claim.",
